1557:- New: `include/kiddos/app/home_carousel_screen.hpp`, `src/app/home_carousel_screen.cpp` — `HomeCarouselScreen` derived from `ui::Screen`, built from `Container`/`Panel`/`Image` plus an app-local status-indicator element (uses only `ui::Renderer` primitives). It mirrors `SDLPlatform::draw_carousel` exactly: side cards `{25,250,190,175}` / `{505,250,190,175}`, center card `{145,135,430,370}` with outer glow outline, artwork rects (`80×90` sides at opacity 180, `200×205` center), title rect `{220,525,280,42}` shown only for the middle game, and the speaker/battery status coordinates and colors. Neighbors are added before the center card so the center overlaps them, and the same wrap-around neighbor mapping (`left = (sel+2)%3`, `right = (sel+1)%3`) is used. Reuses the existing generated BMP artwork (magenta-keyed).
1562:- New tests: `tests/app_ui_action_mapping_test.cpp`, `tests/app_home_carousel_screen_test.cpp` (structure/geometry/visibility without a renderer, plus software-renderer pixel checks of card fills, artwork presence, selection changes, and title visibility).
1570:- **Visual approval is yours to give** — please run `./build/kiddos` from the repo root and inspect. The corner rasterization of the UI library's rounded-fill differs from the platform's helper by at most ~1 px on corner arcs (slightly different inset math); card fills, artwork, title, and status indicators were verified by pixel tests.
1571:- `SDLPlatform::draw_carousel` and its platform-owned carousel/title textures are now unused for the home screen but intentionally left in place (the artwork textures are still used by the manual action screen); they can be removed in a later cleanup.
